# Netflix login script: adb input text with plaintext credentials.
# Matches at any depth, so bin/fireTVnetflixLogin.sh is covered.
fireTVnetflixLogin.sh

# config.php is tracked on purpose: it holds only paths, subnets and a
# hostname test, no credentials. Real secrets live in /etc/ha/config.php.
# If it ever gains a password, rotate first, then git rm --cached it.

# Firebase service-account keys. They live in /etc/ha/ and are a full project
# credential; this is a belt-and-braces guard against an accidental copy.
*service-account*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json

